        "hunk_index": 10,
        "change_category": "bug_fix",
        "intent_summary": "Remove unnecessary SRCU synchronization from amdxdna_hwctx_sync_debug_bo as the xa_load operation no longer requires SRCU protection",
        "what": "Removed srcu_read_lock() and srcu_read_unlock() calls around xa_load operation; changed error goto label from unlock_srcu to put_obj",
        "how": "Eliminates SRCU read-side critical section protection for hardware context lookup, simplifying error handling flow to only release the GEM object without SRCU unlock"
      }
